Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: ExpiringSecret loan `borrowed` cannot be moved
  --> expiring_secret_loan_rejects_move_variadic_and_drop_paths_3.jet:13:56
    |
 13 |         #Unsafe("attempt to discard a loan") { consume(borrowed) }
    |                                                        ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The callback receives temporary read access; moving, changing, or dropping it could let the credential escape its expiry boundary
 Fix: Use the loan only for read-only operations inside this callback
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: `run` doesn't return a value
  --> expiring_secret_loan_rejects_move_variadic_and_drop_paths_3.jet:14:16
    |
 14 |         return 0
    |                ^
 Why: A function hands back a value only when it declares a return type
 Fix: Remove the value (a bare `return`), or write `-> Int` after the parameter list
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113

Error [jet.MissingErrorConversion]: This implicit fallible call can't convert `Expired` into `Err` — no declared conversion exists
